<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa ends mixed, coffee off highs.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa ends mixed, coffee off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Ends mixed after losses caused by stg strength pared on late short covering. Sept up five stg at 1,043 stg.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Up but below highs on firm NY and talk of cold weather in Brazil. Sept up $8 at $1,785.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Tightly mixed, with soon-to-expire August dominating volume. Aug down ten cents at $319.00.</p>
</text>
